>dead body on a non-bones level (to my knowledge, I didn't find a ghost) and as Itried to go back up "A mysterious force prevent you from going up".  Never in
>all my days of hacking has this happened (mind you his was on the VAX while I
>usually play on my PC).  Anyone know anything at all.  Thanks in advance.

     Whenever you move to a new level, the data for your current level
is saved into a file in order to release the memory it's using.  The
"mysterious force" message means that NetHack was unable to create the
needed file.  That indicates a system problem, beyond NetHack's direct
control.  Perhaps the disk you were writing to had completely filled up
or had fallen offline.

     If it happens again, use "!" to get out to a command prompt, and
check the disk from there.  Logout (or perhaps 'exit') to get back into
the game.

